/* Format:
 *   AGENT_DIRECT_DEVELOPMENT_CONTRACT("repo-relative-path")
 *
 * agent_impact_rules.c owns this classification. devloop_plan consumes that
 * owner instead of carrying a second list, and test_impact_composition expands
 * these same rows to prove every direct contract remains impact-routed. */

